    "head_commit_message": "perf(regroup): one hostile index a faction and one hold for every walking squad (spec 38 step 1b)\n\nRegroup built a ScrumNear index of every hostile unit once per drilled\nretreating squad, and held and read the store's columns once per squad.\nEach faction's index is now built once a pass, the first time a squad of\nit needs one, and the walking squads' stores are held once for the walk\nloop, RANK and COLUMN with them so a trade's writes stay visible. No\nnative call runs while the hold is taken. Outcomes are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C7vxfDRgjPbXUCLxV6rXnC",
